ip link show dev tap-0192abcd
ip tuntap add dev tap-0192abcd mode tap user hostd vnet_hdr
ip link set dev tap-0192abcd master br-guests up
bridge link set dev tap-0192abcd isolated on learning off flood off
bridge fdb replace 52:54:01:92:ab:cd dev tap-0192abcd master static
nft add element bridge repose guests { 52:54:01:92:ab:cd . 10.64.4.2 . tap-0192abcd }
nft list counter inet repose egress-g1
nft add counter inet repose egress-g1
nft add rule inet repose guest_dyn ip saddr 10.64.4.2 counter name "egress-g1"
tc qdisc replace dev tap-0192abcd root handle 1: htb default 10
tc class replace dev tap-0192abcd parent 1: classid 1:10 htb rate 200mbit ceil 200mbit
nft delete element bridge repose guests { 52:54:01:92:ab:cd . 10.64.4.2 . tap-0192abcd }
bridge fdb del 52:54:01:92:ab:cd dev tap-0192abcd master
nft -a list chain inet repose guest_dyn
nft delete rule inet repose guest_dyn handle 17
